Title: Need to undertake construction of various roads in Medak Parliamentary Constituency, Telangana -laid. 

SHRI KOTHA PRABHAKAR REDDY (MEDAK): I would like to draw the attention of the Government regarding sanction of Funds for construction of following roads under CRF (Central Road Fund) in my Medak Parliamentary Constituency in Telangana State :-

· Mundrai Nagurajpally Road from Km 0/0 to 18/6 in Nanganoor Mandal (length - 18.6 km , cost Rs. 3400.00 lakhs);

· Machapur — Nangnanoor road from Km 13/8-17/0 in Nanganoor Mandal (length - 3.2 km, cost Rs. 580.00 lakhs);

· AR Sub Headquarters to Karimnagar District Border road 10/2- 16/0 in Chinnakoduru Mandal (length 5.8 km, cost Rs. 1100.00 lakhs);

· Ibrahimpur to Dubbak road from Km 0/0 to 6/2 in Narayanraopet Mandal (length 6.2 km cost Rs. 1200.00 lakhs); 

· Bussapur to Thimmayapally road from Km 20/8 to 30/0 in Chinnakoduru mandal (length of 9.2 km cost Rs. 1700.00 lakhs);

· Dubbak to Mustabad road via Rajakkapet from Km 0/0 to 8/380 in Siddipet Rural Mandal (length 5.6 km cost Rs. 1100.00 lakhs); 

· Dubbak to Mustabad road via Rajakkapet from Km 0/0 to 8/380 in Dubbak mandal (length 8.0 km cost Rs. 850.00 lakhs) and 

· Widening and strengthening of Siddipet R&B road via Rampur, Chelnar, Nandagokul, Naskal, Nizampet link road in Nizampet Mandal, (length 18.3 km cost Rs. 290.00 lakhs). 

I request the Hon’ble Minister of Road Transport and Highways to kindly do the needful. 

